{
  "_doc": [
    "The rule behind `python -m backend.cli templates suggest --text=...` (backend/taxonomy.py). No model is involved:",
    "a signal fires when one of its `words` appears in the text; a question set then earns `weight` points per matched",
    "word (capped at 3) if its `flow` has one of the signal's steps, its `moods` or `tags` overlap, or it is named in",
    "`templates` (x1.5). Writing shorter than `length.short` characters favours sets of <= 3 minutes; longer than",
    "`length.long` favours sets with room to write. Faith-oriented sets (reflection = devotional/prayer) lose",
    "`faith_penalty` points when the `faith` signal did not fire (setting suggest_faith=auto).",
    "Copy this file to data/suggest.json to tune it for yourself; the copy wins."
